# NEW SECTION (HOME's SEL, scenes): a new scene that plays copies of the playing scene's patterns, so that editing it
# leaves the scene it came from as it was; a track with no notes shares its pattern, one with no empty pattern left
# shares it too (said); one undo takes it all back (the copies emptied, the scene gone, the scene before playing),
# the redo makes it again
wait 300
projnew
step 1 1 1 1 100
step 2 1 1 60 100
step 2 1 5 64 100
lock 2 1 1 e1 30
expect scene 1
tap HOME
listen
tap SEL
row NEW SECTION
wait 200
said NEW SECTION S2
tap SEL
wait 100
said NEW S2 its own patterns
expect listopen 0
expect scene 2
expect used 3
# T1 (a kit) and T2 have copies of their own in P2; T3 (no notes) shares P1
expect spat2.1 2
expect spat2.2 2
expect spat2.3 1
expect spat1.1 1
expect spat1.2 1
expect note 1 2 1 1
expect note 2 2 1 60
expect note 2 2 5 64
expect lane 2 2 e1 1
expect pat2 2
# one undo: back on scene 1, scene 2 empty again, the copies gone
listen
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
wait 100
said UNDO new section
unsaid song and scenes
expect scene 1
expect used 1
expect note 2 2 1 0
expect note 1 2 1 0
expect lane 2 2 e1 0
expect lane 2 1 e1 1
expect note 2 1 1 60
# the redo: made again
press HOME
tap PLAY
release HOME
wait 100
expect scene 2
expect used 3
expect spat2.2 2
expect note 2 2 1 60
expect lane 2 2 e1 1
# editing the new section's pattern (T2, Steps: a tap on step 9) leaves scene 1's as it was
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 2
tap SEQ
tapkey w8
wait 50
expect note 2 1 9 0
expect note 2 1 1 60
expect note 2 2 1 60
expect note 2 2 5 64
expect locks2.2.9 0
expect locks2.2.1 1
expect spat1.2 1
expect spat2.2 2
expect note 2 2 9 60
# no empty pattern left on T2 (P3 to P8 hold notes): T2 shares, the others are copied; said how many share
step 2 3 1 60 100
step 2 4 1 60 100
step 2 5 1 60 100
step 2 6 1 60 100
step 2 7 1 60 100
step 2 8 1 60 100
tap HOME
listen
tap SEL
row NEW SECTION
wait 200
said NEW SECTION S3
tap SEL
wait 100
said NEW S3 1 track still shared
expect scene 3
expect spat3.2 2
expect spat3.1 3
expect note 1 3 1 1
# while playing: the new scene comes in at the next bar, the scene before keeps playing until then
tap PLAY
wait 200
expect playing 1
listen
tap SEL
row NEW SECTION
tap SEL
wait 50
said NEW S4
expect spat4.1 4
wait 2500
expect scene 4
tap PLAY
# no lanes left for T2's lock: T2 shares (never half a copy), T1 (no locks) is copied
wait 100
projnew
step 1 1 1 1 100
step 2 1 1 60 100
lock 2 1 1 e1 30
